{"ast":{"_comments":[{"col":1,"line":1,"text":"{ ============================================================================\n  GT2 - Strategy / Orders / Position-info ground-truth  (MultiCharts PowerLanguage)\n  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n  TYPE:  SIGNAL  (PowerLanguage Editor -> New -> Signal)\n\n  WHAT IT DOES\n    A deterministic MA-cross reversal system with protective stops. Appends one\n    comma-delimited row per bar recording position state and order intent. That\n    file is the ground truth for the transpiler's order / position model.\n\n  STYLE (KISS)\n    - One value per line; CSV row is a single flat concatenation, no nesting.\n    - Order syntax is fixed word order: verb (\"label\") qty contract(s) action.\n    - Money-management Set* commands sit at the TOP LEVEL, not inside an If.\n    - Assignment is '='  (never ':=').\n\n  RUN\n    Strategy properties: 1 contract, commission = 0, slippage = 0, bar\n    magnifier OFF (deterministic fills). Delete any old OutPath file first\n    (Print(File()) appends). Record symbol / interval / date-range. Reload once.\n============================================================================ }","trailing":false},{"col":1,"line":47,"text":"{ ---- entries: reversal (opposite signal flattens then flips) ---- }","trailing":false},{"col":1,"line":60,"text":"{ ---- money management: set every bar, at top level ---- }","trailing":false},{"col":1,"line":68,"text":"{ ---- alert on a cross ---- }","trailing":false},{"col":1,"line":72,"text":"{ ---- header row, written once ---- }","trailing":false},{"col":1,"line":75,"text":"{ ---- build the CSV row: flat concatenation, no nesting ---- }","trailing":false},{"col":1,"line":94,"text":"{ ============================================================================\n  ORDER-FORM SYNTAX REFERENCE  (reference only - do NOT uncomment here; the\n  forms would create conflicting orders. Use them as transpiler test inputs.)\n\n    { entries }\n    Buy ( \"LE_limit\" ) 1 contract next bar at Low limit ;\n    Buy ( \"LE_stop\" )  1 contract next bar at High stop ;\n    Buy ( \"LE_qty\" )   2 contracts next bar at market ;\n    SellShort ( \"SE_limit\" ) 1 contract next bar at High limit ;\n    SellShort ( \"SE_stop\" )  1 contract next bar at Low stop ;\n\n    { explicit exits }\n    Sell ( \"LX\" )        next bar at market ;\n    Sell ( \"LX_stop\" )   next bar at EntryPrice - 2 stop ;\n    Sell ( \"LX_limit\" )  next bar at EntryPrice + 4 limit ;\n    BuyToCover ( \"SX\" )       next bar at market ;\n    BuyToCover ( \"SX_stop\" )  next bar at EntryPrice + 2 stop ;\n\n    { this-bar-on-close timing }\n    Buy ( \"LE_close\" )  1 contract this bar on close ;\n    Sell ( \"LX_close\" ) this bar on close ;\n\n    { other money-management forms }\n    SetStopShare ;\n    SetDollarTrailing( 1200 ) ;\n    SetStopPosition ;\n============================================================================ }","trailing":false}],"body":[{"_line":23,"decls":[{"_ident":"FastLen","default":{"type":"number","value":"10"},"name":"fastlen"},{"_ident":"SlowLen","default":{"type":"number","value":"30"},"name":"slowlen"},{"_ident":"StopLossAmt","default":{"type":"number","value":"1000"},"name":"stoplossamt"},{"_ident":"ProfitTgtAmt","default":{"type":"number","value":"2000"},"name":"profittgtamt"},{"_ident":"TrailFloor","default":{"type":"number","value":"1500"},"name":"trailfloor"},{"_ident":"TrailPct","default":{"type":"number","value":"30"},"name":"trailpct"},{"_ident":"BreakEvenAmt","default":{"type":"number","value":"800"},"name":"breakevenamt"},{"_ident":"OutPath","default":{"type":"string","value":"C:\\pl_gt\\GT2_strategy.csv"},"name":"outpath"}],"type":"input_decl"},{"_line":33,"decls":[{"_ident":"FastMA","data_ref":null,"init":{"type":"number","value":"0"},"name":"fastma"},{"_ident":"SlowMA","data_ref":null,"init":{"type":"number","value":"0"},"name":"slowma"},{"_ident":"GoLong","data_ref":null,"init":{